@startuml

title Simulación - Generación de tramas y resultado

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false

skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam classFontSize 18
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 15
skinparam classMethodFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14

skinparam packageTitleFontSize 16
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam Padding 8

skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 20


package "Orquestación" as PKG_RUNNER {

    class SimulationRunner {
        + run(...) : SimulationResult
    }


    class SimulationResult <<resultado>> {
        - success : boolean
        - processedRows : int
        - skippedRows : int
        - devicesConfigured : int
        - message : String
    }
}


package "Dispositivo y trama" as PKG_FRAME {

    class Device {
        - deviceId : String
        - frameCounter : int
        - currentSpreadingFactor : int

        + sendUplink(...)
    }


    class ApplicationPayload {
        - payload : String
        - fPort : int
    }


    class UplinkFrame {
        + toHexString() : String
    }


    Device -[hidden]right- UplinkFrame
    UplinkFrame -[hidden]right- ApplicationPayload
}


SimulationRunner --> Device : ejecuta transmisión
SimulationRunner --> ApplicationPayload : construye por fila
SimulationRunner --> SimulationResult : devuelve

Device --> UplinkFrame : construye

UplinkFrame *-- ApplicationPayload : contiene


note bottom of SimulationRunner
Procesa las filas configuradas
y construye el resultado final.
end note

@enduml